  "details": "The \"Avatar Interaction Override\" and \"User Actions\" sections default to open when you select a player.  If you had previously closed it, when you select a player, it is open, yet the arrow indicates its closed. To close it you must click twice in this state.\n\nRepro:\n\n1. Select a player\n\n2. Close the \"User actions\" section. \n\n3. Back out of the selection.\n\n4. Select any player again.\n\n5. Notice that the sections are open again, but the arrow indicates they are closed.\n\nAttachments:\n\nExample video of this occurring.",
